# S68 slope: S58's turn round at the start's flat top (gas, the stick hard right), then off the gas and
# braked to a stop facing back up the start's line, then gas with the brake still held — the reverse —
# so the bike backs over the edge and down the steep slope ahead of the start, and the stick hard right
# once it is going. Wall-clock, at a quarter speed (4 ms here is 1 ms ridden).
sleep 4000
down cross
sleep 2000
stick l 1 0
sleep 7300
up cross
stick l 0 0
down square
sleep 8000
down cross
sleep 10000
stick l 1 0
sleep 16000
release
